  <ScenTitle>Vivid Sentry, 2018</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;This scenario assumes that, a few years in the future, tensions have increased between Venezuela and the Netherlands.&lt;/P&gt;
